        {
          "text": "Manje qaphelani, kusukela kulolu suku kuya phambili, kusukela osukwini lwamashumi amabili nane lwenyanga yesishiyagalolunye, yebo, kusukela osukwini okwabekwa ngalo isisekelo sethempeli likaJehova, qaphelani.",
